Decodium maintainers
====================

- Salvatore Raccampo, 9H1SR
- Martino, IU8LMC

Decodium is derived from the WSJT-X family of weak-signal applications
originally led by Joe Taylor, K1JT, with contributions from the WSJT-X,
Decodium, Qt, Hamlib and amateur-radio communities.

See the in-application Help > About and copyright information for the
complete component and contributor notices.
